Changes from 0.10.1 to 0.10.2 - released 2026-10-21

Improved: the System Information tab shows the `info-circle` icon in the admin4 design (`Icon=info-circle` in
  settings/menu.ini.append.php)

Fixed: the security checks page (phpsecinfo) parses on PHP 8: no curly brace string offsets

Improved: composer.json states the maintained repository, homepage, support links, authors, PHP 8 and the
  installer name

Improved: ezinfo.php and extension.xml state the version, the license (GPL v2.0 or any later version) and the
  website

Improved: README.md is a complete guide: installation with Composer and by hand, every setting, the pages, the
  status page for monitoring, template operators, permissions, command line scripts and troubleshooting
